<title>USA: DuPont shareholders approve 2-for-1 split.</title>
<headline>DuPont shareholders approve 2-for-1 split.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>DuPont Co said shareholders on Wednesday approved a two-for-one stock split.</p>
<p>The split takes effect May 15.</p>
<p>As of March 7, the company had 579 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
